      "reason": "The bare Nominations heading announces future appointments for all three Academy membership classes. The following row explicitly appoints Denis, de Commercy, as a correspondent at printed page 935."
    },
    {
      "volume": 110,
      "added_events": 1,
      "reason": "The explicit correspondent appointment at printed page 508 includes the honorific Lord. Lord Rayleigh is preserved as transcribed."
    },
    {
      "volume": 50,
      "removed_events": 1,
      "reason": "Unstyled uppercase independent subject headings close the membership column. Milne Edwards, vice-president at page 13, belongs to the separate presidency heading and is removed from this batch ledger."
    },
